stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> LoopState_new: spawn_scheduler
    LoopState_new --> fetching: due
    fetching --> succeed: fetch Ok かつ has_data
    fetching --> fail: error かつ has_data でない
    succeed --> fetching: refresh_secs 経過
    fail --> fetching: backoff_delay 経過
    fetching --> fetching: kick から 2 秒
    note right of fail
        backoff_delay の base は 30 秒
        failures ごとに倍々、上限は refresh_secs
    end note
